  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read `TimelineComposeBox.tsx` in full, `RecipientField.tsx` + `IRecipient` (`EmailComposer.types.ts`), the compose-box API/service that posts to the BFF send path, and the existing `RecipientField` test. Confirm how the send request maps to `SendCommunicationRequest` (`Subject`/`Cc`/`Bcc` already supported server-side).</step>
    <step order="2">Extend the recipient contract minimally: add the resolved entity type (contact vs systemuser) alongside the existing `IRecipient.sourceId` so a resolved recipient carries {email, displayName, resolved, sourceId, entityType}. Keep it backward-compatible for existing `EmailComposer` callers (additive/optional).</step>
    <step order="3">Add the Subject/topic field to `TimelineComposeBox`; wire it to `sprk_subject` and a meaningful `sprk_name` derivation (no "(No Subject)"). Add To/Cc/Bcc rows using `RecipientField` (reuse, not clone) — expose Cc and Bcc (collapsible if the R1 UI warrants). Free-text fallback retained.</step>
    <step order="4">Thread the Subject + structured To/Cc/Bcc (resolved ids + type, plus free-text remainder) through the compose-box send call into `SendCommunicationRequest` so the resolved recipients reach the task-050 participant write at capture and Cc/Bcc populate `sprk_cc`/`sprk_bcc`.</step>
    <step order="5">Verify no `@spaarke/auth` import is added to the shared lib (boundary-injected `authenticatedFetch`/search only). Verify the existing `EmailComposer` callers of `RecipientField` still compile + behave (dual-consumer safety).</step>
    <step order="6">Build the shared lib + the consuming PCF (`npm run build:prod` — NOT `npm run build`, AP-1). Resolve type errors; run the ui-tests below.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` (focus: `RecipientField` reused not cloned, resolved id+type emission, no auth import in shared lib, `EmailComposer` callers unbroken, Fluent v9 dark mode); `adr-check` against ADR-021/028/022 + `spec.md` (FR-10, §11). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (060 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record decisions (the extended recipient contract shape, how resolved id+type flows to `SendCommunicationRequest`, Subject→`sprk_name` derivation).</step>
  </steps>

